<h2>Who needs cold room repair London?</h2>
<p>ColdDirect provides 24/7 same-day cold room repair London across London boroughs. We repair commercial refrigeration for restaurants, hotels, pubs and takeaways when food stock is at risk. An engineer diagnoses on site and gives a clear price before work. Genuine parts are fitted where they match the model. Call 07983 759320, 0800 112 3427 or 0203 952 4822.</p>
<p>Walk-in cold rooms lose temperature when door heaters fail, panels leak or evaporators ice. We work on plant rooms, ceiling evaporators and remote condensers used in hospitality, not household larders. Coverage includes Camden, Islington, Westminster, Barnet, Enfield and Greater London. Tell us whether the site is open, in service or closed.</p>
<p>When you book, say whether the fault started after a delivery, during a hot kitchen service or after a power cut. Keep using your own temperature checks until the engineer has finished. All jobs come with warranty on the agreed work.</p>
<h3>Common faults we fix</h3>
<ul>
<li>Room temperature rising above the set point during service</li>
<li>Ice on the evaporator, blocked drain or wet floor around the door</li>
<li>Noisy condenser fan, short cycling compressor or warm suction line</li>
<li>Door not sealing, broken closer or failed heater tape</li>
<li>Not cooling / warm product, ice build-up, and compressor failure after diagnosis</li>
</ul>
